{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=960 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.mp4?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>he five great sects are selecting a new Wulin Alliance Leader, and as a small nobody wandering the jianghu, how could you possibly miss such a grand event?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But no one expected that a sudden storm of fate would change not only your path\u2026 but the future of the entire wulin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a person who knows no martial arts truly become the hero who saves the wulin?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/c7327cd5c157357f6e3139264e95fd96.avif?t=1764223673\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=1115 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Bagua to adjust your position, create openings for damage, and unleash satisfying bursts at critical moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/562aefa59724fbf86e15917a04229953.avif?t=1764223673\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=1022 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culinary-and-martial dual-cultivation Dayong Sect, the battle-forged Poyun Sect, the unpredictable Qianji Sect\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions from all corners of the land, each wielding their own unique martial arts, and work together to overcome every obstacle on your path through the wulin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardians of Dao is our studio\u2019s first original title.   We warmly welcome your feedback and suggestions\u2014they help us identify issues early and improve the final release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the early Access, please add the game to your wishlist to support our development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=180 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the early Access version of Guardians of Dao, and the full version is currently under active development.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least the following features (and possibly more) will be added in the full release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete storyline and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storylines for five martial sects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight deities for divine blessings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five recruitable heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded progression and meta-upgrade systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional difficulty options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance adjustments and refinements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508510?t=1764223673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/20a36562db261ff2188ed86b84e2f3de36474219/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764223673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/2bc672272ea109d04bf8809c77aa48596c30ca42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764223673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/2bc672272ea109d04bf8809c77aa48596c30ca42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764223673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3511260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=960 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/9ca084e3b3047357ee6cbd8a0bdfbb92.mp4?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>he five great sects are selecting a new Wulin Alliance Leader, and as a small nobody wandering the jianghu, how could you possibly miss such a grand event?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But no one expected that a sudden storm of fate would change not only your path\u2026 but the future of the entire wulin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can a person who knows no martial arts truly become the hero who saves the wulin?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/c7327cd5c157357f6e3139264e95fd96.avif?t=1764223673\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=1115 height=271 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/6cc4912f0c1431cb532332b4e418d51c.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of Bagua to adjust your position, create openings for damage, and unleash satisfying bursts at critical moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/562aefa59724fbf86e15917a04229953.avif?t=1764223673\" width=600 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=1022 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/5d4da99d29566a23754c15386a79f587.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culinary-and-martial dual-cultivation Dayong Sect, the battle-forged Poyun Sect, the unpredictable Qianji Sect\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions from all corners of the land, each wielding their own unique martial arts, and work together to overcome every obstacle on your path through the wulin!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the Dev Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardians of Dao is our studio\u2019s first original title.   We warmly welcome your feedback and suggestions\u2014they help us identify issues early and improve the final release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the early Access, please add the game to your wishlist to support our development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.poster.avif?t=1764223673\" width=180 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/extras/af49c09143614661e7421de2be9f3e0b.webm?t=1764223673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the early Access version of Guardians of Dao, and the full version is currently under active development.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least the following features (and possibly more) will be added in the full release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete storyline and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storylines for five martial sects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight deities for divine blessings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five recruitable heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded progression and meta-upgrade systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional difficulty options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance adjustments and refinements</p></li></ul>","developers":["George Financial Holding Limited Company"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/4f183687d4bb1aab57692b8fc5d3772efb241181/header.jpg?t=1764223673","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<s