23673","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/a4a80289e59ead13278d85463d837f86aeb45d35/ss_a4a80289e59ead13278d85463d837f86aeb45d35.600x338.jpg?t=1764223673"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/08942f290a2288817f569c2a96d026e70c7dbb4e/ss_08942f290a2288817f569c2a96d026e70c7dbb4e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764223673","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508510/08942f290a2288817f569c2a96d026e70c7dbb4e/ss_08942f290a2288817f569c2a96d026e70c7dbb4e.600x338.jpg?t=1764223673"}],"short_description":"&quot;Guardians of Dao&quot;[Wuxia] \u2715 [Deities] \u2715 [Aliens] \u2014 Fate is never a single path.This is a 2D roguelike deck-building strategy game.Channeling divine power to obtain unique Relics and Blessings, recruiting martial heroes, and even stealing alien technology to reshape the battlefield.","steam_appid":3508510,"support_info":{"email":"chinesegamer1666@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, English","type":"game","website":null}